select slug, status, scheduled_at at time zone 'America/Boise' as boise from public.social_enqueue($q$2026-11-06-kx450-setup-sheet$q$, $q$carousel$q$, $q$2023 Kawasaki KX450. About 200 lb, intermediate, hardpack, sand and dunes, stability and comfort at speed the goals. This is the baseline Dialed built, next to the stock settings from the 2023 KX450 owner's manual.

